<title>FINLAND: Finnair April load factor down at 64.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Finnair April load factor down at 64.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish national airline Finnair Oy said in a statement on Monday its passenger load factor fell 0.3 percentage points year-on-year in April to 64.3 percent.</p>
<p>Finnair gave the following statistics:</p>
<p>				  April 1997  March 1997   Yr/yr(pct)</p>
<p> Passengers (thousand)	     566	   576	  +9.8</p>
<p> RPK (million)			 857	 1,048	  -0.3</p>
<p> RTK (million)			 100	   122	  +6.7</p>
<p> Cargo and mail (thousand kg)  6,047	 6,771	 +30.6</p>
<p> Passenger load factor (pct)    64.3	  72.6	  -0.3</p>
<p>April 1997 totals broken down by flight type:</p>
<p>			Passengers   RPK	 RTK	    Cargo</p>
<p>			thousand   million    million     thousand kg</p>
<p> International	 279	 587	  76	    5,333</p>
<p> Domestic		231	 111	  10		545</p>
<p> Charter		  55	 159	  15		168</p>
<p>Load factor (percent) by flight type:</p>
<p>			    April 1997 March 1997  Yr/yr(pct pts)</p>
<p> International		  63.3	 73.4	  +1.0</p>
<p> Domestic			 56.8	 59.0	  -2.1</p>
<p>Finnair's financial year runs from April 1 to March 31.</p>
<p>RPK - revenue passenger km (revenue passengers carried multiplied by km flown)</p>
<p>RTK - revenue tonne km (tonnage of revenue load carried -- passengers, cargo and mail -- multiplied by km flown.</p>
<p>Passenger load factor - RPK as a percentage of available seat km.</p>
<p>Finnair does not give a cargo load factor.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
